  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "青鳥行動記事 - 李江却台語文教基金會 thīn 7/26、8/23罷免聲明"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">李江却台語文教基金會&nbsp;</span></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">thīn 7/26、8/23罷免聲明</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\">編輯部<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiKV4k4nMLdN_Eo0k5XyWrD_Wf3OXC6xf0-O3NXtcPihRjBM41K3e5JCiI2rhI4ohnds_ADKXnmxYDFENL1u12TansMuGCbybpjDXuV3j41gXvRHYXUyw2sRwo2-znLUIOpgj3Ssw2k48c07q35QKiCEfGuxRbzBG_ZXfIE28wnfkN6qmMwAwKAnm4jfRI6\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1347\" data-original-width=\"3892\" height=\"214\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiKV4k4nMLdN_Eo0k5XyWrD_Wf3OXC6xf0-O3NXtcPihRjBM41K3e5JCiI2rhI4ohnds_ADKXnmxYDFENL1u12TansMuGCbybpjDXuV3j41gXvRHYXUyw2sRwo2-znLUIOpgj3Ssw2k48c07q35QKiCEfGuxRbzBG_ZXfIE28wnfkN6qmMwAwKAnm4jfRI6=w617-h214\" width=\"617\" /></a></div></div></div></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"font-size: large;\">李江却台語文教基金會自1997年成立到tann，注心beh恢復台灣各族群語言ê性命，除了發行台語文月刊（《台文通訊BONG報》）hām辦各種推廣活動以外，mā積極招有志做伙推動語文政策改革。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">完全無理性問政ê藍白立委，tsit一年外來，tī國會為非sám做，烏白刣國防、文化等等預算，beh hōo行政權hām司法權bē-tín-bē動，beh通過中共意愛ê法案，利便獨裁中國吞食台灣，對台灣ê未來有極其嚴重ê傷害。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">為著抵抗中國ê侵略，為著延續台灣ê語言文化，本會支持7/26 hām 8/23 ê罷免投票，台灣人民ài鬥陣行動，共同守護tsit个語言多元、文化豐富ê自由國家——台灣。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">【青鳥行動記事】徵稿啟事</span></h4><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">百行百業thīn罷免，本會kah雜誌mā thīn罷免。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><div>自舊年（2024年）5--月，藍白立委提出「國會hùn權」法案起，對台灣民主體制ê破壞就已經開始。民間團體自發tik發起「青鳥行動」，抗議無適任立委ê行為。Tann，政府hōo pìnn kah無法度正常運作，為著守護台灣ê未來，青鳥ê力量集倚做罷免團體，beh透過憲法保障ê權利，罷免tsia-ê無適任立委。</div><div><br /></div><div>人民ê力量，真無簡單tsiah hōo罷免成案，suah無法度得著多數民意ê認同。M̄-koh，lán bē用得失志，lán ài繼續拚，kā疼惜台灣ê心聲，講hōo koh-khah濟人聽。因為若無健康ê問政環境、若無理性ê立院討論，lán所關心ê語言文化政策，mā無法度往好ê方向行。</div><div><br /></div><div>Tsit個月，雜誌用〈Kā台灣還hōo台灣——罷免是因為對台灣ê愛〉、〈阮哭，但是阮無失志——「文山退葆」罷團記事〉兩篇文章tshuā頭，分別tuì整體kah個別罷團ê角度來看tsit擺ê大罷免行動，希望鼓勵逐家做伙來出聲，鬥陣來為lán ê行動思考kah記錄。</div><div><br /></div><div>Lán家己ê國家家己救，lán家己ê歷史家己寫！若有投稿，優先刊登。</div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 377期，2025年8月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative; text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。  </span></div></div></div></div></span></div>"
  },
